    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark technical art direction, restrained cyan/red palette, crisp cards, and clear headline-to-metric hierarchy across viewports. However, polish falls below demo-ready: chart labels are extremely small and the precision–recall x-axis repeats “100%” nonsensically; mobile ablation cards become dense and cramped; secondary copy has weak contrast; the desktop hero leaves excessive dead space; and tablet/mobile headers visibly truncate the navigation, with the mobile header losing the brand name and red-mode action.",
